  "description": "Expanding Horizon 8.0 – Civil Engineering Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad Expanding Horizon 8.0 – Civil Engineering is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping aspiring civil engineers evaluate their technical knowledge and prepare for upcoming internship opportunities. The assessment covers important concepts across core Civil Engineering subjects, encouraging participants to apply theoretical knowledge, develop analytical abilities, and approach engineering problems systematically. Objectives Evaluate fundamentals of Structural Engineering. Assess understanding of Geotechnical Engineering. Strengthen concepts in Fluid Mechanics and Hydraulics. Test knowledge of Transportation Engineering. Evaluate understanding of Environmental Engineering and Building Materials. Encourage technical reasoning and practical problem-solving. Guidelines The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop. Participants must complete the assessment within the stipulated time. Answers will be evaluated based on predefined criteria. Plagiarism and any form of unfair practice are strictly prohibited. The decision of the organizing team will be final. Build Your Fundamentals. Engineer Your Future!",
