    "details": "<p><strong>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Civil Engineering</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad</strong></p>\n<p>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Civil Engineering is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping aspiring civil engineers evaluate their technical knowledge and prepare for upcoming internship opportunities.</p>\n<p>The assessment covers important concepts across core Civil Engineering subjects, encouraging participants to apply theoretical knowledge, develop analytical abilities, and approach engineering problems systematically.</p>\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evaluate fundamentals of Structural Engineering.</li>\n<li>Assess understanding of Geotechnical Engineering.</li>\n<li>Strengthen concepts in Fluid Mechanics and Hydraulics.</li>\n<li>Test knowledge of Transportation Engineering.</li>\n<li>Evaluate understanding of Environmental Engineering and Building Materials.</li>\n<li>Encourage technical reasoning and practical problem-solving.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop.</li>\n<li>Participants must complete the assessment within the stipulated time.</li>\n<li>Answers will be evaluated based on predefined criteria.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism and any form of unfair practice are strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>The decision of the organizing team will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Build Your Fundamentals. Engineer Your Future!</strong></p>",
